WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.290
Your keynote runs eight minutes over.

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:03.530
Who tells the kitchen?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.908
At a conference, that one change

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:06.950
affects the next speaker,

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:08.588
the sound desk, and the team

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.570
about to serve lunch.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.790
Our producer calls the hold.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.410
The stage manager resets the next cue.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:16.930
Hospitality knows when to open the
doors.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.448
Your guests get to finish

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:19.350
a good conversation.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.208
Your team knows exactly

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.210
what happens next.

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:24.710
Planning one event or a whole series?

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:26.008
Tell us what your people

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:26.740
should take away.
